+!+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+!+ Set up an AREX slot-owned NetCDF restart file.
+!-------------------------------------------------------------------
+!     --- AREX_SETUP_NC_RESTART ---
+!-------------------------------------------------------------------
+!     AREX restart files are owned by logical slots, not by the worker
+!     currently running MD.  Therefore the legacy mainRestartSetup flag is not
+!     sufficient: it only tracks one main restart stream.
+!
+!     This helper keeps AREX-specific create/reopen behavior isolated from the
+!     normal PMEMD restart path:
+!       * first write for a fresh slot calls NC_create(..., owrite, ...)
+!         so normal -O / no -O overwrite behavior is preserved;
+!       * restored slots, or slots already written during this run, are reopened
+!         and updated in place;
